{"date":"2019-09-23","platform":"WEB","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/0d/d2/269539_6hqjY.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/0d/d2/269539_6hqjY.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/0d/d2/269539_6hqjY.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/0d/d2/269539_6hqjY.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/0d/d2/269539_6hqjY.jpg"},"summary":"公元1633年，大明水师最年轻旗总路长风护送东厂督公下南洋缉拿要犯，遭遇海兽舰队袭击，全军覆没。路长风被一神秘组织所救，随之来到大航海时代国际贸易中心-吕宋岛。岛民们在大明奇人宋应醒的引领下，建立世界融合城市“万国”，反抗西班牙殖民者的残酷统治。出于调查目的，路长风加入宋应醒的组织“天工”，与万国的奇人异士一起对抗殖民者和海上入侵势力。种种领先于时代的发明创造在此登场，令人叹为观止……在历史与现实交织纠缠中，路长风终于领悟“天工”的奥秘，也解开自己身世之谜。五星连珠彗星回归之夜，路长风宋应醒们将书写任何史书无法记载的传说。","name":"万国志","name_cn":"","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":148,"total_count":161265},{"name":"架空","count":70,"total_count":1233},{"name":"奇幻","count":66,"total_count":473305},{"name":"3D","count":62,"total_count":51174},{"name":"2019","count":50,"total_count":76742},{"name":"战斗","count":46,"total_count":473410},{"name":"原创","count":39,"total_count":621875},{"name":"古代","count":34,"total_count":369},{"name":"浪漫主义","count":33,"total_count":50},{"name":"玄幻","count":32,"total_count":8518},{"name":"中国","count":19,"total_count":31841},{"name":"TV","count":17,"total_count":1407901},{"name":"WEB","count":14,"total_count":72157},{"name":"历史","count":13,"total_count":18959},{"name":"灵樨文化","count":11,"total_count":38},{"name":"热血","count":8,"total_count":213793},{"name":"国漫","count":8,"total_count":15963},{"name":"2019年","count":3,"total_count":3643},{"name":"科幻","count":2,"total_count":253557},{"name":"国创","count":2,"total_count":4188},{"name":"国产动画","count":2,"total_count":5633},{"name":"7月","count":2,"total_count":2068},{"name":"万国志","count":2,"total_count":4},{"name":"古风","count":2,"total_count":948},{"name":"中国动画","count":1,"total_count":2188},{"name":"⊘中国","count":1,"total_count":175},{"name":"S级：典藏","count":1,"total_count":11},{"name":"幻想","count":1,"total_count":3219},{"name":"群像","count":1,"total_count":12890